{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_20799","headline":"思君吟寄□□生 · 卢仝","name":"思君吟寄□□生","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"我思君兮河之壖，我爲河中之泉，君爲河中之青天。\n天青青，泉泠泠。\n泉含青天天隔泉，我思君兮心亦然。\n心亦然，此心复在天之侧。\n我心爲风兮淅淅，君身爲云兮羃羃。\n此风引此云兮云不来，此风此云兮何悠哉，与我身心双裴回。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"卢仝","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_20799.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_20799","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}